{"game": "lort", "language": "english", "appid": 2956680, "month": "2026-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1772323200, "end_date": 1772927999, "month_true_total": 296, "quota": 24, "returned": 24, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 15:04:00 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "220111173", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074763692", "personaname": "MrPjary", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074763692/", "num_games_owned": 218, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4190, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 97, "playtime_at_review": 2421, "last_played": 1790711219, "avatar": "c5da13940a3d4a9e6b84a5d7dc8527e57dcfe942"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun game to play solo or with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1772910961, "timestamp_updated": 1772910961, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220109380", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960864404", "personaname": "pnds", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/badgersaregreat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2239, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1585, "last_played": 1786499015, "avatar": "d13dee6c1fadb6775ad0261c37a37b2470ffaf56"}, "language": "english", "review": "Enjoyable mechanics and progression so far, loving the character play styles. Very clear step between each stage in the process and the need to have weapons at that level, otherwise encounters take a long time and can cost progression, so a lot of run outcome (at least when playing solo) is strongly dependent upon luck.\r\nThe game has a fun \"personality\", and the gameplay loop is engaging. \r\n\r\nIn future I'd love to see some kind of additional layer to the rogue-lite loot system, strong build-around itemization would be fun. Perhaps functionality that introduces options rather than pure random chance to give players a degree more agency in their build direction. \r\n\r\nNot intended as a critique.\r\nLort is ridiculously entertaining.", "timestamp_created": 1772909659, "timestamp_updated": 1772909659, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220099169", "author": {"steamid": "76561198938493377", "personaname": "KCP", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198938493377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 113, "playtime_at_review": 1624, "last_played": 1790732926, "avatar": "b7066fb6ff81e0241bea7620e0bda9e06b669c13"}, "language": "english", "review": "New character is pretty bad jk, but the game is fun", "timestamp_created": 1772902539, "timestamp_updated": 1773089128, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220078656", "author": {"steamid": "76561198241982832", "personaname": "ShnagDude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198241982832/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 605, "last_played": 1771375294, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game just needs some more stuff. maybe a difficulty selectio