"author": {"steamid": "76561199083767680", "personaname": "Infinite", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199083767680/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 19523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10765, "last_played": 1787026173, "avatar": "fe639691663abb66576bc5ed99ecff8c8296e8fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "pretty fun", "timestamp_created": 1772718360, "timestamp_updated": 1772718360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219880020", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072565018", "personaname": "TTVPlatanoFritoo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PlatanoFritoo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2044, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1803, "last_played": 1787003736, "avatar": "9f1f4fd36c0bf87f9a4c2042ca8adfe73a89a9ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "A roguelite with tons of potential to be the best in the genre. I would love to see more weapon varieties in the future, harder difficulty, and an option to loop.", "timestamp_created": 1772715928, "timestamp_updated": 1772715928, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219816291", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081649177", "personaname": "Masta Smoke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198081649177/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 29, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 29, "last_played": 1772646650, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not a game you can jump in solo to pass a little time, you must use matchmaking.", "timestamp_created": 1772646733, "timestamp_updated": 1772646733, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47474747896194458", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1773683203, "developer_response": "We just released an update focusing on difficulty that should make it easier for solo play. Check it out here: https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2956680/view/526495718648578185?", "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219815389", "author": {"steamid": "76561198286975898", "personaname": "Foxdie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198286975898/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 3484, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2400, "last_played": 1782143714, "avatar": "6d28baf7f1c67c66d33a0ad738ccf9853e5c9114"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very gratifying. Big lobby capacity. Lots of perks. Random generating maps. Hopefully the new content keeps coming!", "timestamp_created": 1772646057, "timestamp_updated": 1772646057, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219765512", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114120725", "personaname": "EasternLion", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DJPham/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 580, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 580, "last_played": 1772164893, "avatar": "9dded4223d2e226527636c68ee42149047ef8350"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is very grindy which at points can feel very repetitive. Despite only having almost 10 hours, each run can take so long to complete. Especially when you are new and still need to level up your skills.\n\nIt is fun, I've only played it with friends so its cool to coordinate and plan out what to do. \n\nIt's a 50-50 if you gonna like it", "timestamp_created": 1772597844, "timestamp_updated": 1772597844, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219764562", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079229575", "personaname": "Nox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LamplighterNox/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 263, "last_played": 1787942123, "avatar": "a64410cb10840ecca6729ebc040056db5336ee7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an AMAZINGLY fun game, with a ton of replayability! If I had to vaguely explain it, I'd say it's a mix of Risk of Rain 2 and Battle Royale-style games. Fun solo, or multiplayer- and with a decent balance of being very difficult to start with but offering you permabuffs to help if you're struggling, so it's got a bit for every playstyle bracket, imo.\n\nThe story (and most things in it) don't take themself too seriously, with a lot of fun pop culture references that'll have you (unfortunately) laughing in the middle of a fight and getting yourself nuked into oblivion once you see them. Or if you're like me, the complete inability to stop getting distracted by how over-the-top the first two bosses are and being dead in the first 5mins from laughing while the people I play with run screaming from newfound hyper-aggro.\n\n10/10 game, would absolutely get blasted into oblivion again.", "timestamp_created": 1772596694, "timestamp_updated": 1772596694, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 27, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "219763761", "author": {"steamid": "76561198289452473", "personaname": "PushX2Start", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198289452473/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1047, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 754, "last_played": 1786480768, "avatar": "fb6615c1e2e2ddaed9dced524bdb2ea4546f85c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone who has played a lot of roguelikes in the past, this one feels like the perfect blend of goofy and strategic. I mean really. To be able to slowly gather items, a multitude of weapons and upgrade your characters base three stats of strength, intellect and agility means that there is easily a play style for everyone!\r\n\r\nI do record/stream roguelikes for youtube (Granted, this started recently. But hear me out for a second.) and this one was a blast to be my first roguelike I streamed from my new setup for PC gaming. I had an absolute blast showing this game off to viewers as we journeyed on with out immortal Bernie Blazington after getting six mushrooms to basically have infinite lives in order to finally get my first win. I only needed two, but the sheer randomness of that luck plus the constant pop culture references made this game amazing.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy Risk Of Rain 2 and want something just as much of a struggle while also laughing at the funny memes, do give this game a try. Its worth the low price. I promise!\r\n\r\n10/10 - Get on LORT, get in the van with Lawrence FishBird and blow up some goblins to defeat weird bosses with funny accents.", "timestamp_created": 1772595698, "timestamp_updated": 1772595698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219762720", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165743878", "personaname": "Thromn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165743878/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2231, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1971, "last_played": 1777250799, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "good\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1772594485, "timestamp_updated": 1772594485, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219762276", "author": {"steamid": "76561199322126122", "personaname": "slymaster281", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199322126122/", "num_games_owned": 75, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1026, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 507, "last_played": 1773613431, "avatar": "6c0640f13870942bac7bf72a2acc3196ad42490e"}, "language": "english", "review": "i came i saw i flew", "timestamp_created": 1772593975, "timestamp_updated":